  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Process support and appraisal of Support to Trade Facilitation West Africa (TFWA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the assignment is to provide process support to the finalization of the concept note related to the Danish support to TFWA, to carry out an appraisal of the programme as implemented currently, and to assist APD in formulating the results framework, theory of change, and ultimately the programme document to the Danish Support.</narrative>
  </description>
